              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maku yumbakira Yahova uvwali kandi nahaanira ku vihaanwa viukusambwa kandi vihaanwa viemirembe. Yahova yaavugilira lisaala lia Daudi, kandi uvulwaye vudamanu vwalekera mu kivala cha Isiraeli.",
          "type": "text",
